<title>UK: LME - warehouse stock movements.</title>
<headline>LME - warehouse stock movements.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Jul 11 - Latest LME warehouse stock changes are:</p>
<p>copper up 2800, tin down 30, lead down 125, zinc down 975, aluminium up 6900, nickel down 438, aluminium alloy down 140</p>
</text>
